# Complexity
- Time complexity: $$O(n)$$
- Space complexity: $$O(1)$$

# Code
```java []
class Solution {
    public int sumOfSquares(int[] nums) {
        int n = nums.length;
        int sqSum = 0;

        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {
            if (n % (i + 1) == 0) {
                sqSum += (nums[i] * nums[i]);
            }
        }

        return sqSum;
    }
}
```
